## 2. `libies_mapping.so` 設計

### 2.1 資料來源

從現有 `3rdparty_net_snmp/ies-auto-mibs/net_*.h` 跟 `ies_auto_mibs_setup_*.c` 抽出,
新增 `owner_daemon` 欄位:

```c
struct ies_mapping_entry {
    const oid     *oid;
    size_t         oid_len;
    const char    *uri;              /* "ifmibdb/ifTable/" */
    const char    *uri_index;        /* "ifAdminStatus" */
    int            val_type;         /* SNMP_DATA_TYPE_INTEGER, ... */
    int            mode;             /* HANDLER_CAN_RONLY/RWRITE */
    uint32_t       flags;            /* IES_FLAG_SNMP_* bitfield */
    int            iss_build;        /* 1 = ISS 自家 / 0 = framework */
    const char    *owner;            /* "iss" / "framework" / "fiber_check" / ... */
    /* index handling, value-replace rules ... */
};
```

### 2.2 Data format 選擇

| 選項 | 優 | 缺 | 我的建議 |
|---|---|---|---|
| **a) 直接編進 .so 的 const array** | 啟動快、零 parse | 改 mapping 要重 build .so + 重啟所有 consumer | PoC 用,簡單 |
| **b) Runtime 載 JSON / CBOR** | 改 mapping 不用重 build | parse 成本(~5 ms for 1500 entries)| 中期切換 |
| **c) 混合** — .so 啟動 parse JSON 然後 cache hash table | 啟動可接受、後續 O(1) | 實作稍多 | 最終形態 |

PoC 先走 (a),驗證可行性後再走 (c)。

### 2.3 公開 API(header `libies_mapping.h`)

```c
/* C API, header-only signatures */

/* Lookup */
const ies_mapping_entry_t *
ies_mapping_lookup_by_oid(const oid *o, size_t olen);

const ies_mapping_entry_t *
ies_mapping_lookup_by_uri(const char *uri, const char *uri_index);

/* Iterate (e.g., subagent 啟動時批次 register) */
typedef int (*ies_mapping_iter_cb)(const ies_mapping_entry_t *e, void *ctx);
int ies_mapping_iterate_by_owner(const char *owner,
                                  ies_mapping_iter_cb cb, void *ctx);
int ies_mapping_iterate_by_prefix(const oid *prefix, size_t plen,
                                  ies_mapping_iter_cb cb, void *ctx);

/* Reverse */
const char *ies_mapping_owner_of_oid(const oid *o, size_t olen);

/* Versioning (cross-consumer schema check) */
const char *ies_mapping_version(void);
```

### 2.4 Rust binding

`lib_moxa_rust_ies_mapping` crate(自動 generate from C header):

```rust
pub struct MappingEntry { /* mirrors C struct */ }

pub fn lookup_by_oid(oid: &[u32]) -> Option<MappingEntry>;
pub fn lookup_by_uri(uri: &str, idx: &str) -> Option<MappingEntry>;
pub fn iterate_by_owner(owner: &str) -> impl Iterator<Item=MappingEntry>;
```

framework 是 Rust(actix-web),要這個 binding 才能 register OID 給 master。

